@prefix brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#> .

<http://example.org/test#AHU_1> a brick:AHU ;
    brick:feeds <http://example.org/test#Damper_1>,
        <http://example.org/test#Damper_2> .

<http://example.org/test#Damper_1> a brick:Damper ;
    brick:feeds <http://example.org/test#Room_1> .

<http://example.org/test#Damper_2> a brick:Damper ;
    brick:feeds <http://example.org/test#Damper_21>,
        <http://example.org/test#Damper_22> .

<http://example.org/test#Damper_21> a brick:Damper ;
    brick:feeds <http://example.org/test#Room_2> .

<http://example.org/test#Damper_22> a brick:Damper ;
    brick:feeds <http://example.org/test#Room_2> .

<http://example.org/test#Room_1> a brick:Room ;
    brick:hasPoint <http://example.org/test#Temperature_Sensor_1> .

<http://example.org/test#Temperature_Sensor_1> a brick:Temperature_Sensor .

<http://example.org/test#Temperature_Sensor_2> a brick:Temperature_Sensor .

<http://example.org/test#Room_2> a brick:Room ;
    brick:hasPoint <http://example.org/test#Temperature_Sensor_2> .

